{"verse_key": "14:6", "surah": 14, "verse": 6, "text_uthmani": "وَإِذْ قَالَ مُوسَىٰ لِقَوْمِهِ ٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَةَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ إِذْ أَنجَىٰكُم مِّنْ ءَالِ فِرْعَوْنَ يَسُومُونَكُمْ سُوٓءَ ٱلْعَذَابِ وَيُذَبِّحُونَ أَبْنَآءَكُمْ وَيَسْتَحْيُونَ نِسَآءَكُمْ ۚ وَفِى ذَٰلِكُم بَلَآءٌ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ عَظِيمٌ", "translation": "And [recall, O Children of Israel], when Moses said to his people, \"Remember the favor of Allāh upon you when He saved you from the people of Pharaoh, who were afflicting you with the worst torment and were slaughtering your [newborn] sons and keeping your females alive. And in that was a great trial from your Lord.", "verse_from_ms": 131630, "verse_to_ms": 146130, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَإِذْ", "start_ms": 131630, "end_ms": 132520}, {"i": 1, "text": "قَالَ", "start_ms": 132520, "end_ms": 133220}, {"i": 2, "text": "مُوسَىٰ", "start_ms": 133220, "end_ms": 135020}, {"i": 3, "text": "لِقَوْمِهِ", "start_ms": 135020, "end_ms": 135900}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱذْكُرُوا۟", "start_ms": 135900, "end_ms": 137470}, {"i": 5, "text": "نِعْمَةَ", "start_ms": 137470, "end_ms": 138860}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 138860, "end_ms": 139470}, {"i": 7, "text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "start_ms": 139470, "end_ms": 141360}, {"i": 8, "text": "إِذْ", "start_ms": 141360, "end_ms": 142030}, {"i": 9, "text": "أَنجَىٰكُم", "start_ms": 142030, "end_ms": 142970}, {"i": 10, "text": "مِّنْ", "start_ms": 142970, "end_ms": 145275}, {"i": 11, "text": "ءَالِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 12, "text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 13, "text": "يَسُومُونَكُمْ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 14, "text": "سُوٓءَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 15, "text": "ٱلْعَذَابِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 16, "text": "وَيُذَبِّحُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 17, "text": "أَبْنَآءَكُمْ", "start_ms": null, "en